Pricing on the Pixel 11 Pro <a href="https://store.google.com/category/phones">starts at &#36;1,099</a>, and pricing on the Pixel 11 Pro XL <a href="https://store.google.com/category/phones">starts at &#36;1,299</a>. Pre-orders are live now.<br/>
