<br/>
<h2>Pixel Watch 5</h2><br/>
The Pixel Watch 5 uses the same round display Google's smartwatches are known for, with an improved 3,000-nit brightness level. There are new watch faces and complications, including new generative watch faces.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/08/pixel-watch.jpg" alt="" width="1682" height="928" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1059456" /><br/>
The device has more accurate GPS route tracking, more accurate sleep tracking, new Gemini integrations, and personalized strength coaching. It has context-aware updates on the watch face, surfacing info when it's needed. Raise to Talk engages Gemini, with core actions done on-device.<br/>
<br/>
There are new one-handed gestures for confirming, selecting, and sending content, which are similar to some of the gestures available on the Apple Watch. Google says the Pixel Watch 5 can detect when the wearer stops breathing and can summon help with a new breathing emergency detection feature.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/08/pixel-watch-breathing-emergency.jpg" alt="" width="2162" height="1216" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1059457" /><br/>
The Pixel Watch 5 is <a href="https://store.google.com/us/product/pixel_watch_5">priced starting at &#36;399</a>.<br/>
<br/>
<h2>New Software Features</h2><br/>
<ul><br/>
 	<li><strong>Gemini Intelligence</strong> - Google says Gemini Intelligence can do more multistep tasks across apps. There's a new Rambler voice input feature that removes filler words and corrects run-on sentences, and a sign-to-text feature that supports American Sign Language. There are new location-based insights that show you info based on where you are, and contextually relevant suggestions in text conversations.</li><br/>
 	<li><strong>Magic Capture</strong> - One tap records video that the Pixel edits, crops, and unblurs into a collection of images and video.</li><br/>
 	<li><strong>Camera Looks</strong> - Mirrors the iPhone's Photographic Styles feature, letting users choose an aesthetic (Natural, Shadows, or Vanilla) at the point of capture.</li><br/>
 	<li><strong>Circle to Search</strong> - Circle to Search works in the Camera viewfinder, so you can circle something and get AI info on it.</li><br/>
 	<li><strong>Live Translate</strong> - Google's new devices translate videos and audio in real time.</li><br/>
 	<li><strong>Health Guardian</strong> - An AI Health Guardian monitors insulin resistance trends, blood pressure patterns, and sleep breathing quality trends.</li><br/>
</ul><br/>
<h2>Pixel Tag</h2><br/>
Google also debuted a &#36;29 Pixel Tag that competes with the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/airtag/">AirTag</a>. It links to the Google item tracking network that leverages Android devices to find items. It has much of the same feature set as the &zwnj;AirTag&zwnj;, with details <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/08/12/google-pixel-tag/">available in our full article</a>.<br/>
<br/>
