<h2>More Info</h2><br/>
Google's new product lineup will launch on August 20, just a few weeks ahead of when Apple will unveil its latest smartphone models. We're expecting Apple to announce the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-18-pro/">iPhone 18 Pro</a>, &zwnj;iPhone 18 Pro&zwnj; Max, foldable <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/iphone-ultra/">iPhone Ultra</a>, and new Apple Watch models.<br/>
